<div>
<h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-white leading-tight">Automated Lead CRM</h4>
<p class="text-[9px] text-on-surface-variant leading-tight mt-1 line-clamp-3">Visual drag-and-drop Kanban pipeline. It automatically tracks the exact status of your clients (from 'New Prospect' to 'Closed Deal') so you never forget to follow up.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex items-start gap-2 bg-surface-card/40 p-2 rounded-lg border border-outline-variant hover:border-accent-electric transition-colors">
<div class="text-accent-cyan"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">mark_email_read</span></div>
<div>
<h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-white leading-tight">AI Email Copilot</h4>
<p class="text-[9px] text-on-surface-variant leading-tight mt-1 line-clamp-3">Say goodbye to manual typing. Our system uses advanced AI to instantly read emails, understand the tone, and draft high-converting replies automatically.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex items-start gap-2 bg-surface-card/40 p-2 rounded-lg border border-outline-variant hover:border-accent-electric transition-colors">
<div class="text-accent-emerald"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">travel_explore</span></div>
<div>
<h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-white leading-tight">Maps &amp; Web Scraper</h4>
<p class="text-[9px] text-on-surface-variant leading-tight mt-1 line-clamp-3">Built-in scraping tools allow you to pull hundreds of verified email addresses and phone numbers directly from Google Maps and LinkedIn in just a few clicks.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex items-start gap-2 bg-surface-card/40 p-2 rounded-lg border border-outline-variant hover:border-accent-electric transition-colors">
<div class="text-accent-amber"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">payments</span></div>
<div>
<h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-white leading-tight">Integrated Payments (Stripe)</h4>
<p class="text-[9px] text-on-surface-variant leading-tight mt-1 line-clamp-3">Easily accept payments via credit cards through secure Stripe checkout integration directly embedded into your software.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex items-start gap-2 bg-surface-card/40 p-2 rounded-lg border border-outline-variant hover:border-accent-electric transition-colors">
<div class="text-indigo-400"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">sync</span></div>
<div>
<h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-white leading-tight">Real-Time Data Sync</h4>
<p class="text-[9px] text-on-surface-variant leading-tight mt-1 line-clamp-3">Connects seamlessly with your existing tools like Google Sheets, Slack, and AirTable. If a client signs up, you instantly get a notification on your phone.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex items-start gap-2 bg-surface-card/40 p-2 rounded-lg border border-outline-variant hover:border-accent-electric transition-colors">
<div class="text-rose-400"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">wifi_off</span></div>
<div>
<h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-white leading-tight">Offline Reliability</h4>
<p class="text-[9px] text-on-surface-variant leading-tight mt-1 line-clamp-3">Lost your internet connection? No problem. The app continues to work perfectly offline and automatically saves your work to the cloud once you reconnect.</p>
</div>
</div>
